{
  "name": "My workflow 3",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# 🎯 AI Email Lead Nurturing & Engagement System\n\n**Workflow Overview:**\n\n**Step 1: Lead Intake & Enrichment**\n- Captures lead data from forms or webhooks\n- Enriches with behavioral and demographic data\n- Validates and scores lead quality\n\n**Step 2: AI Behavior Analysis**\n- Analyzes lead pain points and motivations\n- Identifies optimal communication style\n- Determines journey stage and priorities\n\n**Step 3: Custom Sequence Generation**\n- Creates personalized email sequences\n- Tailors messaging to lead's specific needs\n- Generates multiple touchpoint strategies\n\n**Step 4: Psychological Trigger Testing**\n- A/B tests subject lines with different psychological triggers\n- Tests urgency, curiosity, social proof, and personalization\n- Optimizes for highest engagement rates\n\n**Step 5: Engagement-Based Follow-ups**\n- Tracks opens, clicks, and replies\n- Adjusts sequence based on engagement patterns\n- Escalates hot leads and nurtures cold ones\n\n**Output:** Fully automated, personalized email nurturing system that adapts based on lead behavior and engagement.",
        "height": 780,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -2700,
        -120
      ],
      "id": "3fa9bec8-cc83-4ad8-b1c6-b8e76ea2afc0",
      "name": "Workflow Overview"
    },
