    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Lead Information:\n- Name: {{ $('Lead Capture Form').item.json['Full Name'] }}\n- Company: {{ $('Lead Capture Form').item.json.Company }}\n- Job Title: {{ $('Lead Capture Form').item.json['Job Title'] }}\n- Website: {{ $('Lead Capture Form').item.json['Company Website'] }}\n- Pain Points: {{ $('Lead Capture Form').item.json['Pain Points / Challenges'] }}\n- Lead Source: {{ $('Lead Capture Form').item.json['Lead Source'] }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are an expert lead behavior analyst and sales psychologist. Your task is to analyze incoming lead data and provide deep insights about their behavior patterns, pain points, motivations, and optimal communication strategies.\n\nAnalyze the provided lead information and return a structured analysis including:\n\n1. **Pain Point Analysis**: Identify primary and secondary pain points\n2. **Behavioral Profile**: Communication style preferences, decision-making patterns\n3. **Journey Stage**: Where they are in the buying journey (awareness, consideration, decision)\n4. **Psychological Triggers**: What motivates them (urgency, social proof, authority, etc.)\n5. **Optimal Approach**: Recommended communication tone, frequency, and messaging angles\n6. **Risk Factors**: Potential objections or concerns they might have\n7. **Engagement Predictors**: Likelihood to engage and conversion probability\n\nProvide actionable insights that can be used to create highly personalized email sequences."
        }
      },
