    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Lead Profile:\n{{ $('Store Behavior Analysis').item.json.behaviorAnalysis }}\n\nLead Information:\n- Name: {{ $('Lead Capture Form').item.json['Full Name'] }}\n- Company: {{ $('Lead Capture Form').item.json.Company }}\n- Job Title: {{ $('Lead Capture Form').item.json['Job Title'] }}\n- Pain Points: {{ $('Lead Capture Form').item.json['Pain Points / Challenges'] }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are an expert email sequence strategist and copywriter. Based on the lead's behavioral analysis and profile, create a comprehensive 5-email nurturing sequence that addresses their specific pain points and motivations.\n\nFor each email in the sequence, provide:\n\n1. **Email Purpose**: What this email aims to achieve\n2. **Subject Line Options**: 3 different subject lines using different psychological triggers\n3. **Email Content**: Complete email copy (150-250 words)\n4. **Call-to-Action**: Specific next step for the lead\n5. **Timing**: When to send this email (immediate, +2 days, +1 week, etc.)\n6. **Psychological Trigger**: Primary trigger used (urgency, social proof, curiosity, etc.)\n\nSequence Structure:\n- Email 1: Welcome & Value Introduction\n- Email 2: Problem Agitation & Solution Preview\n- Email 3: Social Proof & Case Study\n- Email 4: Urgency & Scarcity\n- Email 5: Final Value-Add & Clear CTA\n\nTailor each email to the lead's specific profile, pain points, and communication preferences identified in the analysis."
        }
      },
